{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261117/photo/bkn-20261117105241017-1117_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261117105525\"/><p>銀線灣泳灘已懸掛紅旗。</p><p>康樂及文化事務署今日（11月17日）宣布，由於大浪關係，西貢區的銀線灣泳灘已懸掛紅旗，顯示在該處游泳會有危險，市民請勿在該處游泳。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T03:07:11.002313+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":85,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T02:52:41+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T15:29:26.599107+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T03:00:46.803051+00:00","content_hash":"77c8e84d9a3d3c0365c820d08be7c6ff9281eeced2f0bd47282c9df21b7b52f3","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-17T03:07:11.002313+00:00","latest_fallback":"minimal","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}